WEBVTT

00:46:29.373 --> 00:46:31.630
And thanks to Dave Fano for joining.

00:46:31.654 --> 00:46:33.698
His new company is called Teal.

00:46:33.722 --> 00:46:36.603
It's focused on helping people
build fulfilling careers.

00:46:37.662 --> 00:46:44.533
(Music)

00:46:45.146 --> 00:46:46.798
DF: How was the sound, everything,

00:46:46.822 --> 00:46:48.385
no crazy background sound?

00:46:48.409 --> 00:46:50.877
I tried to make, like,
a makeshift sound booth here.

00:46:50.901 --> 00:46:52.258
AG: Of course you did.

00:46:52.282 --> 00:46:53.748
(Laughter)

00:46:53.772 --> 00:46:57.303
I'm thinking, OK, this is the guy
who designed all those cool spaces,

00:46:57.327 --> 00:47:00.323
he better have a great
studio setup at home.